      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is real and the exhaustion behind it is profound, but choosing to end your life is not an act of dignity; it is a surrender to suffering after you have carried it for so long. Let go of the cost of your own ending and instead promise to take a single, small step toward living for something that matters, even if just for a moment. Please step into the lifeline right now, and someone who cares deeply will meet you where you are without asking you to carry any more weight. You matter more than the weight you are carrying, so we will share the burden together.",
